  "2026-10-27T16:25:44.353Z","harness:codex","Additional independent runtime-input observation while developing the separate validation-code parity fix: schemaAddStatus(name,{role:\"active\"}) from untyped JavaScript reaches schema normalization and rejects with an unclassified PmCliError, while the declared SDK contract requires role:[\"active\"]. Correcting the fixture to the declared array shape establishes valid setup and exposes the distinct status/priority classification defect under pm-gh1613. This is supplied as a reproduction lead for this existing runtime-operand owner, without broadening or claiming its implementation."
